Z||000000||Philphine||09-26-2001||01:42 AM||||<BR>just doing some dreaming. i know i've read here an ls1 won't fit or not as easily. was it to long or to wide or too high?<P>also, what is the weight advantage of an ls1 compared to a iron smallblock or lt1? or to a north star or 4.9 caddy engine? <P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wannabe||09-26-2001||10:11 AM||||LS1 is approx. 80 lbs lighter than a small block with al. heads, and within 15lbs +/- of a N* or 4.9.||||reg||1
