Z||000005||Philphine||09-28-2001||10:07 AM||||it's the chop top i got from fierodave. i haven't done any mods. that's how i got the car. like i said, it would only be a slight advantage. <P> it dosen't have a normal trunk lid. the area over the engine compartment lifts off so there are no hinges.i could even cut away some of the hinge mount a little. i know that area has to be trimmed for other engines.<P>also i have a little more height. the rear deck is raised (think in terms of the top of your engine to the bottom of the lid when it's closed) about 1-1 1/2". <BR>again, i heard (read) it's a harder fit, but if something about the changes made made it easier to fit in, i could add it to the list of possibles.   ||||reg||1
